{"id":"rdd44","designation":"RDD 44","title":"Material Exchange Format — Mapping and Application of Apple ProRes","state":"active","suite":null,"official":{"family_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/doc/rdd44/","latest_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/latest/rdd44/","checked_at":"2026-11-18"},"scope":"This Registered Disclosure Document (RDD) specifies the mapping of ProRes bitstreams into a subset of the MXF Generic Container (SMPTE ST 379-2:2010). This document also defines application restrictions. The ProRes bitstream is documented by SMPTE RDD 36. ProRes bitstreams are mapped into a Picture Essence Track of the MXF Generic Container with Frame Wrapping. This RDD defines the KLV coding, the required Keys (Universal Labels) and MXF Picture Essence Descriptor items.","outline":[{"level":1,"title":"1 Scope","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"2 Conformance Notation","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"3 Normative References","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"4 Glossary of Acronyms, Terms and Data Types","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"5 ProRes Mapping Specifications and Application Considerations","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"5.1 Essence Containers","page":4},{"level":3,"title":"5.1.1 Files with a Single Picture Essence Track","page":4},{"level":3,"title":"5.1.2 Files with Multiple Essence Tracks","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"5.2 Generic Container Mapping","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"5.3 Essence Segmentation and Index Tables","page":5},{"level":3,"title":"5.3.1 General","page":5},{"level":3,"title":"5.3.2 Files That Are Not Segmented","page":5},{"level":3,"title":"5.3.3 Files with Essence Segmented into Fixed Duration Partitions","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"5.4 Random Index Pack","page":6},{"level":2,"title":"5.5 Header Metadata and Descriptor Property Values","page":6},{"level":3,"title":"5.5.1 Local Set and Pack Tags","page":6},{"level":3,"title":"5.5.2 Edit Rate","page":6},{"level":3,"title":"5.5.3 Sample Rate","page":6},{"level":3,"title":"5.5.4 ContainerConstraintSubDescriptor (infor